<title>USA: WesterFed names Lyle Grimes chairman.</title>
<headline>WesterFed names Lyle Grimes chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MISSOULA, Mont. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>WesterFed Financial Corp, the holding company for Western Federal Savings Bank of Montana, said Monday it had named Lyle Grimes as chairman of the boards of both the company and the bank.</p>
<p>He will continue to hold the posts of president and chief executive officer of both the company and the bank.</p>
</text>
